#!args --open apps/PaintCraft/tests/fixtures/a6_photo.png
# jxlmod.uis (jxl-module) -- JPEG XL is saved by the writer module next to the exe (jxlenc.dll /
# jxlenc.so, which `python build_rs.py app PaintCraft` builds into the app's folder; loaded on
# the first JPEG XL save): no note in the save dialog, Bemühung and Filmkörnung on, the files
# are the new writer's (their sizes: lossy quality 90 effort 7, lossless effort 7 -- the same
# as saveopt.uis's; jxlmod_off.uis has the compatible writer's).  Window 24595 = the save dialog.
size 1280 800
theme light
shot build/tests/jxlmod/mod_start.png
cmd 103
click #81932
key ctrl+a
type "../../../../build/tests/jxlmod/mod.jxl"
click button:"Speichern"
expect window 24595 open
window 24595
expect text:"Hinweis: Das JPEG-XL-Modul (jxlenc) fehlt. Gespeichert wird mit dem einfachen Schreiber: nur Qualität und Verlustfrei wirken." missing
expect #6026 enabled
expect #6026 value 7
expect #6039 enabled
expect #6022 value 90
sync
expect #6100 text "ok"
expect #6100 value 20092
click #6023
expect #6039 disabled
sync
expect #6100 text "ok"
expect #6100 value 89954
window any
click button:"OK"
expect window 24595 closed
expect #9911 text "mod.jxl"
expect #9905 value 0
